              <h2>Keyword Research Strategy</h2>
              <h4>The wisdom of life consists in the elimination of non-essentials. (Lin Yutang)</h4>
              <p>Keywords are one of the crucial components of SEO strategy for formulating search results. Their value is mainly based on the number of people using these specific words in their search queries. However, a sound keyword strategy rests not only on the keywords you choose to include but also on those you omit.</p>
              <p>Keyword research not only helps out SEO but it also helps out different content marketing campaigns. To help them choose the right course of action, we try to explain all the pros and cons of <a href="/seo-vs-google-ads">SEO vs. PPC</a> to our clients during consultation calls. If you opt for local Chicago SEO services, our team will determine the most potent target keywords for your industry and create an SEO strategy aimed at reaching your business goals. We excel at discovering underrepresented opportunities in high-traffic searches as part of our local SEO services, so don't hesitate to give us a call.</p>
