                <h2>Analytics and Reporting</h2>
                <p>Before we start optimizing your website for search engines, our Chicago SEO company will conduct a comprehensive <a href="/why-you-need-seo-audit">SEO Audit</a> to get a better insight into its current performance. That includes:</p>
